## h i g h l i g h t s
A hierarchical $\mathrm{Co}_{9}\mathrm{S}_{8}@\mathrm{NiO}$ composite was designed for supercapacitor. The prepared cathode exhibits a high specific capacitance of $1627\mathrm{~F~g}^{-1}$ . A typical ASC device delivers a potential practical application.  The remarkable performance was closely related to the unique structure.
g r a p h i c a l a b s t r a c t
A rational nanostructure design and facile synthesis method by using ZIF-67 as a template were proposed to fabricate an outstanding supercapacitor cathode. A typical ASC device delivers a remarkable cycling stability and potential practical application.
